    <string name="settings_gestures">Gestures</string>
    <string name="settings_gestures_body">• Swipe up: shifted character (9 → (, \' → \")\n• Swipe down: Ctrl+key (c → ^C); on the number row F1–F12\n• Long press: same as swipe up\n• Drag on space: move the cursor (with Shift: select)\n• Esc/Ctrl key: tap for Esc, hold with another key for Ctrl\n• Ctrl, Alt, Shift, Fn: tap once for the next key, double tap to lock, or hold while typing\n• Fn + digits: F1–F10, Fn + ⌫: Del, Fn + h j k l: arrows, Fn + y o: Home End, Fn + u i: PgDn PgUp\n• Arrow keys: swipe up for Home/End/PgUp/PgDn, hold to repeat\n• The strip shows special keys you sent (Esc, ^C, Tab…)</string>
